<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= typeof csrfToken !== 'undefined' ? csrfToken : '' %>">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
    <noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap"></noscript>
    <link href="/public/css/tools.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="icon" href="/public/assets/favicons/logoFD.webp" type="image/webp">
    <title>Mi Panel | FitData</title>
    <style>
        /* ── HERO ── */
        .dash-hero {
            padding: 88px 5% 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0fdf4 0%, #eff6ff 100%);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .dash-hero-inner {
            max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex; align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem;
        }
        .dash-identity { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem; }
        .dash-avatar {
            width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--green); color: white;
            font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(34,197,94,.35);
        }
        .dash-identity h1 {
            font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
            font-weight: 800; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .dash-identity h1 span { color: var(--green); }
        .dash-identity p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--gray); margin-top: .25rem; }
        .dash-hero-btns { display: flex; gap: .8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .btn-hero {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            padding: .65rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 10px;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none; transition: all .2s;
        }
        .btn-hero-primary { background: var(--green); color: white; }
        .btn-hero-primary:hover { background: var(--green-dark); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .btn-hero-outline { background: white; color: var(--dark); border: 2px solid var(--border); }
        .btn-hero-outline:hover { border-color: var(--green); color: var(--green-dark); }

        /* ── QUOTE BANNER ── */
        .quote-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #16a34a 0%, #0891b2 100%);
            padding: 1.4rem 5%;
        }
        .quote-banner-inner {
            max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem;
        }
        .quote-icon { font-size: 2rem; flex-shrink: 0; opacity: .85; }
        .quote-text { color: white; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6; }
        .quote-text strong { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
        .quote-author { font-size: .78rem; opacity: .8; margin-top: .3rem; }

        /* ── QUICK ACCESS ── */
        .dash-quick {
            max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem 5% 0;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .quick-card {
            background: white; border: 2px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none; transition: all .22s;
        }
        .qc-green:hover  { border-color: #22c55e; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-3px); }
        .qc-orange:hover { border-color: #f97316; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-3px); }
        .qc-blue:hover   { border-color: #3b82f6; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-3px); }
        .qc-purple:hover { border-color: #a855f7; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-3px); }
        .quick-icon {
            width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.3rem; flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .qc-green  .quick-icon { background: #dcfce7; }
        .qc-orange .quick-icon { background: #ffedd5; }
        .qc-blue   .quick-icon { background: #dbeafe; }
        .qc-purple .quick-icon { background: #f3e8ff; }
        .quick-info .quick-label { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--gray); font-weight: 500; }
        .quick-info .quick-value { font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.2; }

        /* ── SECTION ── */
        .dash-section {
            max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2.5rem 5%;
        }
        .section-heading {
            font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark);
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem;
        }
        .section-heading::after {
            content: ''; flex: 1; height: 2px; background: var(--border); margin-left: .4rem;
        }

        /* ── RESULTS SUMMARY ── */
        .results-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .result-stat {
            background: white; border: 2px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.2rem;
            text-align: center; transition: all .2s;
        }
        .result-stat:hover { border-color: var(--green); box-shadow: var(--shadow); transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .rs-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
        .rs-label {
            font-size: .7rem; color: var(--gray); font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em;
        }
        .rs-value {
            font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: .3rem;
            word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 100%;
        }
        .rs-value.has-data { color: var(--green-dark); }
        .rs-value.no-data { color: #94a3b8; }
        .results-empty {
            margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.3rem;
            background: var(--light); border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: .85rem; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .results-actions { margin-top: 1.2rem; display: flex; gap: .8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .btn-result-action {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            padding: .65rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 10px;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none; transition: all .2s;
        }
        .btn-result-green { background: var(--green-soft); color: var(--green-dark); }
        .btn-result-green:hover { background: var(--green); color: white; }
        .btn-result-blue { background: #eff6ff; color: #2563eb; }
        .btn-result-blue:hover { background: #2563eb; color: white; }

        /* ── TOOL CARDS ── */
        .tools-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.4rem;
        }
        .tool-card {
            background: white; border: 2px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden;
            text-decoration: none; color: inherit;
            transition: all .25s; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
        }
        .tool-card-accent { height: 5px; }
        .tc-green  .tool-card-accent { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #22c55e, #4ade80); }
        .tc-orange .tool-card-accent { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f97316, #fb923c); }
        .tc-blue   .tool-card-accent { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #60a5fa); }
        .tc-purple .tool-card-accent { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #a855f7, #c084fc); }
        .tc-green:hover  { border-color: #22c55e; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .tc-orange:hover { border-color: #f97316; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .tc-blue:hover   { border-color: #3b82f6; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .tc-purple:hover { border-color: #a855f7; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .tool-card-inner { padding: 1.4rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .6rem; }
        .tool-card-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
        .tool-card-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.3; }
        .tool-card-desc { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; flex: 1; }
        .tool-card-cta {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
            font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: .4rem; transition: gap .2s;
        }
        .tc-green  .tool-card-cta { color: #16a34a; }
        .tc-orange .tool-card-cta { color: #ea580c; }
        .tc-blue   .tool-card-cta { color: #2563eb; }
        .tc-purple .tool-card-cta { color: #9333ea; }
        .tc-green:hover  .tool-card-cta,
        .tc-orange:hover .tool-card-cta,
        .tc-blue:hover   .tool-card-cta,
        .tc-purple:hover .tool-card-cta { gap: 9px; }

        /* ── ACCOUNT ── */
        .dash-account {
            max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 5% 3rem;
        }
        .btn-logout {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            padding: .7rem 1.4rem; background: #fff1f2;
            color: #e11d48; border: 2px solid #fecdd3;
            border-radius: 10px; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;
            transition: all .2s;
        }
        .btn-logout:hover { background: #e11d48; color: white; border-color: #e11d48; }

        /* ── OVERFLOW GLOBAL — evita scroll horizontal en todo el panel ── */
        html, body { overflow-x: hidden; max-width: 100%; }

        /* min-width: 0 en todos los hijos de grid y flex para que no rebosen su celda */
        .dash-hero-inner > *,
        .dash-quick > *,
        .results-grid > *,
        .tools-grid > *,
        .results-actions > * { min-width: 0; }

        /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */

        /* Tablet: 4 quick-cards en una fila, resultados en 4 columnas */
        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .dash-quick { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .results-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
        }

        /* Móvil grande: apilamos el hero, ajustamos grids */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .dash-hero { padding: 82px 4% 28px; }
            .dash-hero-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
            .dash-hero-btns { width: 100%; gap: .6rem; }
            .btn-hero { flex: 1; justify-content: center; }

            .quote-banner { padding: 1rem 4%; }
            .quote-banner-inner { gap: .8rem; }
            .quote-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; }
            .quote-text { font-size: .82rem; }

            .dash-quick {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                padding: 1.5rem 4% 0;
                gap: .75rem;
            }

            .dash-section { padding: 2rem 4%; }
            .results-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .tools-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .dash-account { padding: 0 4% 2.5rem; }
            .results-actions { flex-direction: column; }
            .btn-result-action { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
        }

        /* Móvil pequeño: reducimos avatar y texto */
        @media (max-width: 380px) {
            .dash-avatar { width: 48px; height: 48px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
            .dash-identity h1 { font-size: 1.1rem; }
            .quick-icon { width: 38px; height: 38px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
            .quick-info .quick-value { font-size: .85rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ── NAVBAR ── -->
<nav class="tool-nav" aria-label="Navegación principal">
    <a href="/panelcontrol" class="nav-logo">Fit<span>Data</span></a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="/indicesantr">Herramientas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
        <li><a href="/misdatos">Mis datos</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/logout" class="nav-cta" style="background:#fff1f2;color:#e11d48;border:2px solid #fecdd3;">↩ Salir</a>
</nav>

<main>

<!-- ── HERO ── -->
<%
const initials = user.nombreUsuario
    .trim().split(/\s+/)
    .map(w => w[0]).slice(0, 2).join('').toUpperCase();
const hasData = userData && (userData.imc || userData.vo2 || userData.gasto_energetico || userData.macro);
%>
<div class="dash-hero">
    <div class="dash-hero-inner">
        <div class="dash-identity">
            <div class="dash-avatar"><%= initials %></div>
            <div>
                <h1>Hola, <span><%= user.nombreUsuario.split(' ')[0] %></span> 👋</h1>
                <p>Bienvenido a tu panel personal de FitData</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dash-hero-btns">
            <a href="/misdatos" class="btn-hero btn-hero-outline">📊 Mis datos</a>
            <a href="/indicesantr" class="btn-hero btn-hero-primary">Ir a herramientas →</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── BANNER MOTIVACIONAL ── -->
<div class="quote-banner">
    <div class="quote-banner-inner">
        <div class="quote-icon">💬</div>
        <div class="quote-text">
            <strong>"<%= frase.texto %>"</strong>
            <div class="quote-author">— <%= frase.autor %></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── ACCESOS RÁPIDOS ── -->
<div class="dash-quick">
    <a href="/indicesantr" class="quick-card qc-green">
        <div class="quick-icon">⚖️</div>
        <div class="quick-info">
            <div class="quick-label">Antropometría</div>
            <div class="quick-value">IMC & ICC</div>
        </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/valoracion" class="quick-card qc-orange">
        <div class="quick-icon">🔥</div>
        <div class="quick-info">
            <div class="quick-label">Nutrición</div>
            <div class="quick-value">Gasto Energético</div>
        </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/pruebaEsfuerzo" class="quick-card qc-blue">
        <div class="quick-icon">🫁</div>
        <div class="quick-info">
            <div class="quick-label">Esfuerzo físico</div>
            <div class="quick-value">VO₂ Máximo</div>
        </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/misdatos" class="quick-card qc-purple">
        <div class="quick-icon">📋</div>
        <div class="quick-info">
            <div class="quick-label">Historial</div>
            <div class="quick-value">Mis datos</div>
        </div>
    </a>
</div>

<!-- ── MIS ÚLTIMOS RESULTADOS ── -->
<div class="dash-section">
    <h2 class="section-heading">📊 Mis últimos resultados</h2>
    <div class="results-grid">
        <div class="result-stat">
            <div class="rs-icon">⚖️</div>
            <div class="rs-label">IMC</div>
            <% if (userData && userData.imc) { %>
                <div class="rs-value has-data"><%= userData.imc %></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="rs-value no-data">—</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="result-stat">
            <div class="rs-icon">📏</div>
            <div class="rs-label">ICC</div>
            <% if (userData && userData.icc) { %>
                <div class="rs-value has-data"><%= userData.icc %></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="rs-value no-data">—</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="result-stat">
            <div class="rs-icon">🔥</div>
            <div class="rs-label">GET (kcal)</div>
            <% if (userData && userData.gasto_energetico) { %>
                <div class="rs-value has-data"><%= userData.gasto_energetico %></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="rs-value no-data">—</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="result-stat">
            <div class="rs-icon">🫁</div>
            <div class="rs-label">VO₂ Máx</div>
            <% if (userData && userData.vo2) { %>
                <div class="rs-value has-data"><%= userData.vo2 %></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="rs-value no-data">—</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="result-stat">
            <div class="rs-icon">⚡</div>
            <div class="rs-label">METs</div>
            <% if (userData && userData.mets) { %>
                <div class="rs-value has-data"><%= userData.mets %></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="rs-value no-data">—</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="result-stat">
            <div class="rs-icon">⏳</div>
            <div class="rs-label">Expect. Vida</div>
            <% if (userData && userData.expect_vida) { %>
                <div class="rs-value has-data"><%= userData.expect_vida %></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="rs-value no-data">—</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="result-stat">
            <div class="rs-icon">🥩</div>
            <div class="rs-label">Macros</div>
            <% if (userData && userData.macro) { %>
                <div class="rs-value has-data" style="font-size:.85rem; white-space:pre-line;"><%= userData.macro %></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="rs-value no-data">—</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </div>

    <% if (!hasData) { %>
    <div class="results-empty">
        Aún no tienes resultados guardados. Usa las herramientas de abajo y guarda tus cálculos para verlos aquí.
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="results-actions">
        <a href="/misdatos" class="btn-result-action btn-result-green">📋 Ver todos mis datos</a>
        <% if (hasData) { %>
        <a href="/generar-pdf" class="btn-result-action btn-result-blue" target="_blank">📄 Descargar PDF</a>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── HERRAMIENTAS ── -->
<div class="dash-section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <h2 class="section-heading">🛠 Herramientas</h2>
    <div class="tools-grid">

        <a href="/indicesantr" class="tool-card tc-green">
            <div class="tool-card-accent"></div>
            <div class="tool-card-inner">
                <div class="tool-card-icon">⚖️</div>
                <div class="tool-card-title">Índices Antropométricos</div>
                <div class="tool-card-desc">Calcula tu IMC e ICC para evaluar tu composición corporal, riesgo cardiovascular y peso ideal.</div>
                <span class="tool-card-cta">Calcular →</span>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/valoracion" class="tool-card tc-orange">
            <div class="tool-card-accent"></div>
            <div class="tool-card-inner">
                <div class="tool-card-icon">🥗</div>
                <div class="tool-card-title">Valoración Nutricional</div>
                <div class="tool-card-desc">Obtén tu TMB, gasto energético total y distribución de macronutrientes adaptada a tus objetivos.</div>
                <span class="tool-card-cta">Calcular →</span>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/pruebaEsfuerzo" class="tool-card tc-blue">
            <div class="tool-card-accent"></div>
            <div class="tool-card-inner">
                <div class="tool-card-icon">🏃</div>
                <div class="tool-card-title">Prueba de Esfuerzo</div>
                <div class="tool-card-desc">Evalúa tu capacidad aeróbica con el cálculo de VO₂ Máximo y METs según tu nivel de actividad.</div>
                <span class="tool-card-cta">Calcular →</span>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/blog" class="tool-card tc-purple">
            <div class="tool-card-accent"></div>
            <div class="tool-card-inner">
                <div class="tool-card-icon">📖</div>
                <div class="tool-card-title">Blog de Nutrición y Deporte</div>
                <div class="tool-card-desc">Artículos científicos sobre alimentación, clasificación de alimentos y rendimiento deportivo.</div>
                <span class="tool-card-cta">Leer artículos →</span>
            </div>
        </a>

    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── CUENTA ── -->
<div class="dash-account">
    <h2 class="section-heading">⚙️ Cuenta</h2>
    <a href="/logout" class="btn-logout">
        <span>↩</span> Cerrar sesión
    </a>
</div>

</main>

<!-- ── FOOTER ── -->
<footer class="tool-footer">
    <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
            <a href="/panelcontrol" class="nav-logo">Fit<span>Data</span></a>
            <p>Herramientas científicas de evaluación física para todos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
            <h3>Herramientas</h3>
            <a href="/indicesantr">IMC</a>
            <a href="/icc">ICC</a>
            <a href="/pruebaEsfuerzo">VO₂ Máximo</a>
            <a href="/valoracion">Gasto Energético</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
            <h3>Legal</h3>
            <a href="/privacyPolicy">Privacidad</a>
            <a href="/avisoLegal">Aviso legal</a>
            <a href="/politicacookies">Cookies</a>
            <a href="/contact">Contacto</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">&copy; 2026 FitData. Todos los derechos reservados.</div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
